p1 = 3x^2 - 2x + 5
p2 = x - 1
p3 = 4 (degree 0)
p1 + p2 = 3x^2 - x + 4
p1 - p1 = 0
p1 * p2 = 3x^3 - 5x^2 + 7x - 5
(p1 * p2)' = 9x^2 - 10x + 7
p2^5 = x^5 - 5x^4 + 10x^3 - 10x^2 + 5x - 1
x=-2  p1=  21  p1*p2=  -63  p2^5=  -243
x= 0  p1=   5  p1*p2=   -5  p2^5=    -1
x= 1  p1=   6  p1*p2=    0  p2^5=     0
x= 3  p1=  26  p1*p2=   52  p2^5=    32
r = 1/2x^2 + 1/3, r(3) = 29/6
sum of k*x^(k%3), k=1..6: 7x^2 + 5x + 9
